+//===- comgr-llvm23-compat.h - AMDGPU TargetParser queries for LLVM 23 ------===//
+//
+// The ROCm fork's TargetParser answers per-GPU questions that the TargetParser
+// of LLVM 23 cannot. The table is the fork's generated AMDGPUTargetParserDef.inc
+// (llvm-tblgen -gen-amdgpu-target-def on AMDGPU.td), reduced to the fields
+// Comgr reads, and the accessors follow AMDGPUTargetParser.cpp of the fork.
+//
+//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
